<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Rural Sports - Masculino</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #d0d4d5;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #000;
    }

    .nav {
      height: 110px;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 50px;
      background-color: #d0d4d5;
    }

    .nav img {
      height: 80px;
      width: auto;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .nav ul {
      display: flex;
      list-style: none;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .nav ul li a {
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #000;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      position: relative;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .nav ul li a::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      bottom: -5px;
      height: 2px;
      width: 0;
      background-color: #2c7a7b;
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .nav ul li a:hover {
      color: #2c7a7b;
    }

    .nav ul li a:hover::after {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 60px 100px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .content-left {
      width: 40%;
    }

    .content-left h5 {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .content-left h1 {
      font-size: 50px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .content-left p {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      color: #333;
    }

    .btn {
      background-color: #000;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 15px;
      padding: 12px 40px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 50px;
      border-top-left-radius: 0;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      margin-right: 15px;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background-color: #2c7a7b;
      transform: scale(1.05);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .content-right {
      width: 55%;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .product {
      background-color: #f1f1f1;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 10px rgba(17, 0, 17, 0.15);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .product:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .product img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 250px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .product h3 {
      margin: 10px 0 5px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .product p {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .product span {
      color: #2c7a7b;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="nav">
    <img src="/imagem/logo_pagina_inicial.png" alt="logo">
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/">Início</a></li>
      <li><a href="/homem">Homem</a></li>
      <li><a href="/mulher">Mulher</a></li>
      <li><a href="/colecao">Coleção</a></li>
      <li><a href="/contato">Contato</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <div class="content-left">
      <h5>Explore nossa linha masculina</h5>
      <h1>Camisetas Masculinas<br>Rural Sports</h1>
      <p>Descubra conforto e estilo com as melhores camisas masculinas para o seu time favorito.</p>
      <button onclick="window.location.href='/produtos'" class="btn">Ver Produtos</button>
      <button onclick="window.location.href='/produtos/novo'" class="btn">Cadastrar Produto</button>
    </div>

    <div class="content-right">
      @each(product in products)
        @if(product.description.toLowerCase().includes('homem') || product.name.toLowerCase().includes('mascul'))
          <div class="product">
            @if(product.imageUrl)
              <img src="{{ product.imageUrl }}" alt="Imagem do produto">
            @endif
            <h3>{{ product.name }}</h3>
            <p>{{ product.description }}</p>
            <span>R$ {{ product.price }}</span>
          </div>
        @endif
      @endeach
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
